Acme Systems (www.acmesystems.it)  is shipping a tiny 32 bit RISC Core 
Module based on the Axis ETRAX 100LX MCM processor (100 bogoMIPS). The FOX 
board  comes with preinstalled embedded Linux Kernel 2.6 with MMU.

Main characteristics
Size: 65x71mm. Weight: 40g. Power consumption: 1W with 5v single power 
supply.
1 Ethernet port (10/100Mb), 2 USB 1.1 host ports, 4MB Flash, 16MB RAM.
Standard 2.54mm headers with extensive I/O lines (3 TTL serial ports, I2C, 
IDE, SCSI, Parallel and generic I/O ports).

Preinstalled software
The FOX board is shipped with a ready to run Linux environment (Kernel 
image, Server WEB, FTP, TELNET, SSH, drivers etc.) on the internal Flash.

SDK
A complete Open Source Linux environment is available for free. With the SDK 
is it possible to fully change the standard environment.

Availability
The FOX board is available in volume production now.

